            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha 82",
            "review_text": "Janis G\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom157 contributions\n1\nA tasty experience.\nNov 2018 • Solo\nBBQ belly pork pieces grilled over an open charcoal fire are placed on top of a bowl of rice noodles in broth with green leaves and bean sprouts on the side. You add the green leaves to the broth a mouthful at a time. It all works very well and I enjoyed it immensely. The 2 tricky things are sitting on the kindergarten size stools and not leaving a trail of tasty food down your chin. Definitely worth the experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 10, 2018",
